am/apps/3234410/extras/17869e04a60cf7539750fc45768fe32e.mp4?t=1754573730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Buy drinks from the vending machines and gain great powers from the bosses when you defeat them. Before each battle, buy items from your sister Cassandra, who will be waiting for you just before each boss fight.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/b993260569c551d74e32bd3d817cf865.avif?t=1754573730\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.poster.avif?t=1754573730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.webm?t=1754573730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.mp4?t=1754573730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get your starting ticket from your adoptive mother Melinda and begin in the castle of your choice. Between levels, choose with the conductor Mak \u2014 from a random selection \u2014 which castle you want to advance to.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/3848af47150af6523d061657a065e752.avif?t=1754573730\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.poster.avif?t=1754573730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.webm?t=1754573730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.mp4?t=1754573730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Face a total of five intense and challenging boss battles against the kings or queens of each castle \u2014 with two available in this demo.","developers":["Kimu Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3201780","name":"Steam Veins"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234410/header.jpg?t=1754573730","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Steam Veins DEMO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 460 / Radeon HD 5850<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / Radeon R9 280X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kimu Studios"],"ratings":{"dej